      "duration": 8.0,
      "text": {
        "en": "The cat stayed on the summit and guarded the nest, just as it had promised.",
        "de": "Die Katze blieb auf dem Gipfel und bewachte das Nest, genau wie sie es versprochen hatte."
      },
      "image": "res://resources/assets/cutscenes/story_covered_nest.png"
